1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,240
M: Ms. Lee, I'm calling to let you know about the results of the interview you had with us on Monday.

2
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:09,740
I've gotten the word from my boss that the position is yours if you're still interested.

3
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:11,040
W: Are you kidding?

4
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:13,640
I mean, of course I am still interested.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:14,805
M: That's great.

6
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:17,540
When do you think you will be able to start your new position?

7
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:19,600
Is next Monday okay?

8
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:28,820
W: I'm sorry, but I have not had a chance to inform my current boss about my quitting here, and I think I have to give him two-week's notice to find a replacement.

9
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:30,720
How about the first of June?
